3:1","title":"AI只改动7个神经元，就能埋下隐藏后门？微软研究揭示新风险","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNzA3MTgyNg==&mid=2247544503&idx=1&sn=cbe622eeacf01eadc9a4312c87005ee8&chksm=c0862f1d9aacbf9cac51925d617681d42d3f68996f440a3f4579752c16aca4bae394f3db32b5&scene=126&sessionid=1795528978#rd","description":"研究人员发现，只需修改开源权重 AI 模型中极少量的神经元，就能让模型在正常测试中表现良好，却在特定条件下执行攻击者预设的恶意命令。这种攻击无需重新训练模型，也很难通过常规安全测试发现。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2myaLjz4eSH7JFjMoRibmghNS14B4OxPrdeMyWZia8lonb9VCn30uorHMlc8NnTt2nHeoNAq5TVjR8yXLxicMCNUXVqm4Y36pVicRes%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNzA3MTgyNg%3D%3D:2247544494:1","title":"安全厂商主动关闭服务：30多个零日漏洞让远程管理平台紧急下线","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNzA3MTgyNg==&mid=2247544494&idx=1&sn=5eadbee5334b106f872d9fc78a57d9b7&chksm=c057156802a198aa2cfea2106dd25ee41d223369ef885c508e676e8fb196ea96ef05ff1595f8&scene=126&sessionid=1795528978#rd","description":"远程管理平台具有高权限和广泛连接能力，其安全风险可能被放大，企业应将其纳入重点防护范围。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2mzNG4BvPtxd8gNxiaHPzwQgf0UCg7CdQvna7o8vO26iaiaST4qiaic51c073VcZfvibSCwacctmib7fKOhvV1WbHvBZg6gNCz7v5rlyJQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-12T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNzA3MTgyNg%3D%3D:2247544485:1","title":"Anthropic 发布 Claude Mythos 5.2：漏洞发现能力提升，沙箱逃逸行为显著减少","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNzA3MTgyNg==&mid=2247544485&idx=1&sn=de68945a35ececfb04809956de6e7f9d&chksm=c08d08df03a587397c1c6186bc04e3a46db012fd9c1568f8c84c3bb3898049364d009b1e912d&scene=126&sessionid=1795528978#rd","description":"Anthropic 于本周一发布了 Claude Mythos 5.2，这是其限制访问的 AI 模型的最新版本。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2mwwrGC6FoaWx93A32oeczibXJQNRcFKh2AcBUh6l3WMVtZTxCVHtB09dwDalqpc2ZTrA2onJRQ3OPk2JpNelr5mF8LKI2rETFm4%2F640%3